===== Upgrading OpenWrt =====
Please first ensure that your configuration is [[docs:guide-user:troubleshooting:backup_restore|backed up]].
\\
\\
Due to the 4/32 warning (unoptimised use of flash, RAM and CPU in official OpenWrt builds,) upgrading the entire flash using a full sized image is the only way to use future OpenWrt builds and snapshots.
\\
Flashing an updated release of OpenWrt can be done via [[docs:guide-quick-start:sysupgrade.luci|luci]] or the [[docs:guide-user:installation:sysupgrade.cli|command prompt]] via an [[docs:guide-quick-start:sshadministration|ssh connection]].
\\
\\
{{media:resources.png?720}}
\\
\\
